-- Writing, one set per essay type (Agree or disagree, Discuss both views,
-- Positive or negative, Advantages & disadvantages, Problems & solutions,
-- Two-part questions), numbered by test (T1–T91).
-- Writing stays homework-only: these are never put on the students' shelf.
-- Safe to run twice. Needs migration 92 first.

